# Generated skill inventory lock — superseded by provenance-backed discovery.
/skills.lock.json

# Existing checkout runtime/ephemeral state only; symlink adoption is prohibited.
# (gt town-level mayor/refinery/witness live in ~/gt, NOT here, so not ignored here):
/.beads.gate.lock
/crew/
/polecats/
# Provider projection destinations (config/projections.json). Project-owned
# selection and root instruction documents are source; every derived provider
# artifact below them is runtime state. Both the
# agentsctl projector and the gas city pack runtime write here: this repository
# is a registered rig, so the pack runtime drops skill symlinks and an ownership
# manifest into the provider trees at any time, unprompted. These are runtime
# state, never source.
#
# This ignore list IS the enforcement:
# tests/test_tracker_suspension.py asserts that no projection artifact is
# tracked, staged, or offered as untracked source. A destination missing here
# would be offered as source and fail that guard, so the two must agree.
/.agents/*
!/.agents/projection.json
/.claude/
/.codex/
/.cursor/
/.gemini/
/.opencode/
/.github/agents
/.github/hooks
/.github/instructions
/.github/skills
/GEMINI.md

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/
.gqlout.json
.poolside/
.poolside/

# Gas City
.beads/*
!.beads/identity.toml
